            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"at-checklist\"><div class=\"at-checklist__intro\"><p class=\"at-checklist__eyebrow\">04 / Before you order</p><h2 id=\"first-run\" class=\"at-checklist__title\">Plan the first run</h2></div><ol class=\"at-checklist__items\"><li><strong>Garment samples</strong><p>Order the tee and any layer in your colors. Check the fit, feel and shade before you commit.</p></li><li><strong>Palette and size offer</strong><p>Choose 2 or 3 colors that come in every size you plan to sell, including any women&rsquo;s or youth fits.</p></li><li><strong>Complete unit cost</strong><p>Add decoration, freight, packaging and selling costs to the blank price to check your selling price works.</p></li><li><strong>Opening quantity and restock</strong><p>Shelf stock needs a restock plan and a backup color. A preorder or limited release needs a close or launch date.</p></li></ol><p class=\"at-checklist__note\"><strong>Outfitting staff instead?</strong> Explore <a href=\"/collections/groups-events\">Groups &amp; Events</a> for a committed list of people, sizes and a handoff date.</p></div>"
